      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hukumu kwa Mataifa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Karibuni, enyi mataifa, mpate kusikia; sikilizeni, enyi kabila za watu; dunia na isikie, nacho kiijazacho, ulimwengu na vitu vyote viutokavyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maana BWANA ana ghadhabu juu ya mataifa yote, na hasira kali juu ya jeshi lao lote; amewaangamiza kabisa, amewatoa waende kuchinjwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watu wao waliouawa watatupwa nje, na uvundo wa maiti zao utapaa juu, na milima itayeyushwa kwa damu yao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
